{"blt147cdbe31df876a0":{"uid":"blt147cdbe31df876a0","locale":"zh-cn","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"_version":2,"content":"Sale","sap_uid":"SaleParagraphComponent","tags":[],"title":"Sale Paragraph Component","publish_details":[{"environment":"blt74fc65a8e8dc5b90","locale":"zh-cn","time":"2026-08-19T09:22:53.948Z","user":"blt341a8902da09a539","version":2}]},"bltf63f6e2f041330c9":{"locale":"zh-cn","uid":"bltf63f6e2f041330c9","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"_version":2,"content":"<div class=\"global-alerts\"><div class=\"alert alert-info\" role=\"alert\"><strong>信息：<strong>正在建设中页 - 不完全功能</div></div><a name=\"00\"></a><div class=\"textpage textpage-faqs\"><div class=\"item_container\">\t\t<h2><a name=\"a00\"></a>退货和退款</h2>\t\t<p>正文</p>\t\t<a class=\"pagetop-link\" href=\"#00\">返回页首</a>\t</div>\t\t<div class=\"item_container\">\t\t<h2><a name=\"b00\"></a>送货信息</h2>\t\t<a class=\"faq-menulink\" href=\"#b01\">送货选项</a>\t\t<a class=\"faq-menulink\" href=\"#b02\">送货时间和收费标准</a>\t\t<a class=\"faq-menulink\" href=\"#b03\">订单跟踪信息</a>\t\t<a class=\"faq-menulink\" href=\"#b04\">快递状态信息</a>\t\t\t<h3><a name=\"b01\"></a>送货选项</h3>\t\t<p>\t\t\t可用的送货选项显示在&ldquo;结算&rdquo;区域的&ldquo;送货方式&rdquo;下面。<br><br>\t\t\t这些选项可能并不全部适用，具体取决于您的送货地址：\t\t\t</p><ul>\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<b>送货上门</b> - 英国免费标准送货，适用于超过 L50 的所有订单，四个工作日内送达（*不排除有例外情况）\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<b>标准送货</b> - 1 ~ 2 个营业日\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<b>其他送货方式</b> &ndash; 3 ~ 5 个营业日\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<b>国际送货</b> &ndash; 7 ~ 10 个营业日（并非适用所有国家）\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t<p></p>\t\t<h3><a name=\"b02\"></a>送货时间和收费标准</h3>\t\t<p>\t\t\t大多数订单将在 4 个工作日内*送达，收费 L3.99；超过 L50 的订单免费送货（*不排除有例外情况，详见下表）。\t\t\t</p><ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t英国境内的送货时间为星期一至星期五早上 9 点至下午 6 点（银行假日除外）。 \t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t苏格兰高地和岛屿、近海和北爱尔兰等地的送货可能需要更长时间。<br>\t\t\t\t\t有关爱尔兰共和国境内的送货，请访问 hybris.com 的爱尔兰站点。\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t多件货品可能会分包装分批次送货。\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t<p></p>\t<h3><a name=\"b03\"></a>订单跟踪信息</h3>\t\t<p>\t\t\t我们将在订单各个阶段通过电子邮件向您发送更新信息。每封邮件均会显示订单的当前状态。各订单状态详见下表说明。大多数包裹都通过我们自己的快递公司送货。您可以点击邮件中的包裹参考链接来跟踪这些包裹。点击链接后，系统会重定向至相关快递站点。有关快递状态的信息，请 <a href=\"#b04\">单击此处</a>。\t\t</p>\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<th>状态</th>\t\t\t\t\t<th>说明</th>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 1-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>正在处理</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单正在处理中。<br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 2-->\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已派发</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单已派发至快递公司。<br><br>    对于较大较重的产品，您的订单将派发至我们的承运单位。承运单位将与您联系并安排合适的送货日期。<br><br>对于&ldquo;店铺自提&rdquo;订单，在店铺完成备货后会向您发送订单状态更新信息（查看下面有关店铺自提状态的更多信息）<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 3-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已取消<br>无法履行<br> 付款撤销</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单因库存不足已被取消，未接受任何付款。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 4-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已取消<br>无法履行<br>已退款</strong><br>\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单因库存不足已被取消。我们已将款项退回到您的支付卡上。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 5-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>退货已收到</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">我们已收到您的退货。但是，货物寄送到了错误的仓库需要重新转送，因此，相关退款处理可能会有一定延迟。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 6-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>完成备货等待自提</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单已经完成备货，请到所选店铺提货。<br><br><strong><i>请注意：</i></strong>您必须在收到通知邮件的 14 天内完成提货。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 7-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已提货</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t您的订单已完成提货。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 8-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>退货进行中</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t我们正在处理您的退货。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 9-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>退货退款完成</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t我们已完成您的退货处理。<br><br><strong><i>请注意：</i></strong>某些银行在处理退款时可能花费较长时间。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t</table>\t\t<p></p>\t\t<h3><a name=\"b04\"></a>快递状态信息</h3>\t\t<p></p>\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<th>状态</th>\t\t\t\t\t<th>说明</th>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<!--ROW 1-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>订单已生成</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的订单已完成备货并进入快递系统。<br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 2-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>中转站已收货</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t您的包裹已到达中转站。 <br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 3-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已在中转站处理</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的包裹已经过中转站流程准备分派给快递员。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 4-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>分派给快递员</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的包裹已离开中转站并分派给快递员。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t<!--ROW 5-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>快递员将重新送货</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t快递员已尝试送达您的包裹并将重新尝试送货。您会收到确认送货尝试的卡片。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t<!--ROW 6-->\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blue3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>已送达</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"grey3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t您的包裹已送达。<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t</tab